    <statement><p>A fluid has density 2 and velocity field 
<m>\mathbf{v} = x\boldsymbol{j}-y\boldsymbol{i}+4z\boldsymbol{k}</m>.</p>
<p>Find the rate of flow outward through the sphere 
<m>x^{2} + y^{2} + z^{2} = 4</m>:</p>
<p><fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{4\cdot 4\cdot 2\cdot 4\cdot 2\pi }{3}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
